  <item>
    <title>我在重男轻女的重灾区，见不到第二种表达</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bca94dcace72dff87228dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bca94dcace72dff87228dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Feb 2024 08:35:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期的故事量很丰富，所有的表达都坦诚至上。也期待你和我们简单聊聊。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宇萌 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5898a6325e87e7366183c55a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865416" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5898a6325e87e7366183c55a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865416"><span>看宇萌的小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>VT </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557c18223397db5d58d819ec?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865455" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557c18223397db5d58d819ec?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865455"><span>看VT的小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务联系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>沸沸 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56f672364775a7224734bab5?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865505" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56f672364775a7224734bab5?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=557c18223397db5d58d819ec&amp;apptime=1706865505"><span>看沸沸的小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>——————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> &nbsp;出生在重男轻女知名地区，VT的日常感受是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> &nbsp;小的时候做「娘娘腔」，怎么找到自己的归属感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> &nbsp;VT能和朋友走到一起，多亏了缺位的「父亲」和年夜饭的大小桌。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> &nbsp;被迫「扶弟」，让女生成为家庭的受迫害者。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> &nbsp;落后的成长观念和培育氛围，是困住孩子的隐藏障碍。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> &nbsp;期待与「小男人」有未来，坦诚可能是旅馆小老板的第一项愿望。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> &nbsp;播客或许能提供环境。帮助我们找到更适合自己的性别教育。</span></p>]]></description>
